WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:23.600
Mystery of the Hieratic Text

00:01:29.180 --> 00:01:31.470
That's The Winged Dragon of Ra?

00:01:31.770 --> 00:01:32.990
Hey...

00:01:32.990 --> 00:01:33.910
That's...

00:01:34.120 --> 00:01:36.350
That's The Winged Dragon of Ra?

00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:41.150
I know the sun is supposed to be round, but this is ridiculous!

00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:45.580
That Ra looks nothing like the one that appeared in my duel.

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:53.370
But I sense a massive aura that shakes the heavens, a power worthy of a God.

00:01:53.370 --> 00:01:55.230
That is clearly a God.

00:01:55.500 --> 00:02:01.760
By tributing my Harpie Lady Sisters, I should be able to summon a God.

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:03.960
Why is this happening?

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:06.160
Don't worry, woman.

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:11.540
You did summon the real The Winged Dragon of Ra.

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:14.350
The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:02:14.350 --> 00:02:16.210
So that's the real deal?

00:02:16.620 --> 00:02:17.920
I thought so.

00:02:18.140 --> 00:02:23.510
Unfortunately, a duelist like you can't control a God.

00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:27.590
Only those chosen by God can control it.

00:02:27.590 --> 00:02:29.260
Don't be silly!

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:36.420
When a duelist summons a card, that duelist gets to use its abilities!

00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:39.040
This God Card will obey me!

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:43.980
Look at the God Card in your Duel Disk.

00:02:45.280 --> 00:02:46.210
What?

00:02:46.840 --> 00:02:50.480
There are cryptic hieroglyphs in the card's text space.

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:52.600
How strange.

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:57.520
When I took this card from Marik, there was nothing in the text space.

00:02:58.300 --> 00:03:02.130
But there are hieroglyphs now!

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:06.100
Can you read the text?

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:11.370
The text explains how to awaken Ra's true power.

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:13.570
Ra's true power?

00:03:13.780 --> 00:03:18.040
Yes.  Ra's terrifying effects.

00:03:19.140 --> 00:03:21.710
Ra's effects!

00:03:21.710 --> 00:03:24.250
I want to see what that card can do!

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:31.160
Mokuba, use our satellite to scan the God Card on Mai's Duel Disk.

00:03:31.420 --> 00:03:33.960
Oh right!  We can do that!

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:36.090
I'm going to the control room.

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:40.030
What's written on the Ra card?

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:45.140
I don't know what the text says.

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:46.860
It's impossible for you.

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:54.080
If you can't decipher the text, you can't use the God nor activate its effects.

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:56.750
But I'll tell you one thing.

00:03:56.750 --> 00:04:01.250
It's ancient writing known as hieratic text.

00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:02.780
What's that?

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:04.420
Hieratic text!

00:04:04.820 --> 00:04:06.360
Ancient writing!

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:11.640
It was used in ancient Egypt for law, literature and religion.

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:15.530
Only those with special status could read it.

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:19.570
Only the chosen ones can understand it.

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:22.570
Such as my family of gravekeepers.

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:23.980
No way!

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:28.550
There are cards in this game that only special people can use?

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:32.740
Even Pegasus J. Crawford, the creator of Duel Monsters...

00:04:32.740 --> 00:04:36.050
...couldn't decode Ra's effects.

00:04:36.480 --> 00:04:41.560
He had no choice but to copy the tablet's hieratic text onto the card.

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:47.000
And he made it so that the text would appear only when Ra is summoned.

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:51.200
He gave me the card because he knew I couldn't control a God Card!

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:55.250
Ra is in Sphere Mode, like an egg.

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:59.420
Try to figure out how to change it into Battle Mode!

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:06.940
Try to control the God, Mai Kujaku!

00:05:12.060 --> 00:05:12.940
Mai!

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:14.600
Damn that Marik!

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:18.230
He was never worried about having his Ra stolen from him!

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:22.170
Marik wanted Mai to summon Ra!

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:27.680
Mai Kujaku tributed three Harpie Ladies to summon the God.

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:33.860
Ra's attack and defense points are equal to the total of the tributed monsters.

00:05:33.860 --> 00:05:39.850
Ra has 5400 attack points and 4200 defense points.

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:42.530
But the God is doing nothing.

00:05:42.530 --> 00:05:45.460
It won't attack nor defend.

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:49.630
What does the text say in order to make Ra move?

00:05:49.840 --> 00:05:52.800
I don't know how to control a God...

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:57.260
You only have a disobeying God on your field.

00:05:57.260 --> 00:06:02.300
If I attack next turn, the God won't protect you.

00:06:03.290 --> 00:06:08.480
If you don't make the God move, you'll experience more hell next turn.

00:06:08.800 --> 00:06:11.910
C'mon.  Pray to your God.

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:14.080
I have no choice.

00:06:14.080 --> 00:06:15.590
I set a card!

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:17.450
I end my turn!

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:21.200
I set the trap Gravity Bind.

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:26.460
When it activates, all Level 4-or-higher monsters can't move.

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:29.170
I'll use that time to solve Ra's secrets.

00:06:29.170 --> 00:06:30.370
My turn.

00:06:32.320 --> 00:06:34.410
I summon Holding Legs!

00:06:36.770 --> 00:06:40.910
Too bad, but this monster has an effect.

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:46.450
When it appears on the field, all set cards return to our hands.

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:55.560
When I have both Holding Arms and Holding Legs, Ujat's Tablet appears!

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:04.520
Neither God, spells nor traps will protect you.

00:07:04.520 --> 00:07:07.620
Let the darkness and pain embrace you, Mai Kujaku!

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:10.240
Holding Arms!  Holding Legs!

00:07:29.740 --> 00:07:30.330
Mai!

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:34.770
No way!  This is Solid Vision, but I can't move!

00:07:34.770 --> 00:07:37.770
I told you this was a Shadow Game.

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:41.740
All illusions become real.

00:07:41.740 --> 00:07:43.840
Even the pain you're feeling.

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:46.310
Attack her directly!

00:07:52.770 --> 00:07:54.350
Mai!  Hang in there!

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:58.280
I can hear that warm voice again...

00:08:00.260 --> 00:08:01.510
Succumb to the pain!

00:08:01.510 --> 00:08:02.920
Stop it, Marik!

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:09.670
Isn't this entertaining, Yugi?

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:13.300
The ritual sacrifice to the darkness is starting.

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:15.250
Sacrifice to the darkness?

00:08:15.250 --> 00:08:16.800
Listen closely.

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:19.530
Ra has three effects.

00:08:19.530 --> 00:08:21.680
I'll reveal one of them.

00:08:21.900 --> 00:08:24.600
What?  Three effects?

00:08:32.220 --> 00:08:34.590
Is he chanting a spell?

00:08:42.260 --> 00:08:44.130
Yugi!  Look at that!

00:08:49.680 --> 00:08:52.010
Ra's sphere is changing shape!

00:08:54.270 --> 00:08:55.310
What's this?

00:08:59.800 --> 00:09:02.200
This is one of Ra's effects.

00:09:02.620 --> 00:09:07.020
Since I chanted the text correctly, God will serve me.

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:13.740
Arise for my victory, The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:09:19.900 --> 00:09:22.600
This is The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:09:23.840 --> 00:09:24.840
That's...

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:26.380
The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:31.160
My turn.

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:35.820
Ra's crimson flames will burn her up!

00:09:37.460 --> 00:09:38.250
Mai!

00:09:38.700 --> 00:09:42.280
Ra's attack will eliminate Mai's life points.

00:09:42.280 --> 00:09:46.120
Since this is a Shadow Game, when Mai loses...

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:50.570
You'll make a good sacrifice, Mai Kujaku.

00:09:50.780 --> 00:09:56.280
The only thing you can do is surrender by putting your hand on your deck.

00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:59.510
Ra will instantly burn you to death.

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:04.880
You and your memories will be turned into ash and vanish into the darkness!

00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:07.160
No!  At this rate, Mai will be...

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:08.380
Stop this, Marik!

00:10:08.380 --> 00:10:10.040
The match is over!

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:12.320
You don't have to attack any more!

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:14.400
Watch closely, Yugi.

00:10:14.400 --> 00:10:16.910
I'll sacrifice her to the darkness.

00:10:16.910 --> 00:10:20.520
And draw out your hatred to the fullest.

00:10:20.520 --> 00:10:21.480
Marik!

00:10:21.700 --> 00:10:24.680
The tattoo of memories carved into my back...

00:10:25.110 --> 00:10:31.110
It shows the location of the Pharaoh's memories, which my family has guarded for 3000 years.

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:35.410
So that we could present it to the Pharaoh when his soul resurrects.

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:37.350
Tattoo of memories...

00:10:37.750 --> 00:10:42.000
This was my family's mission passed on through generations.

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:49.960
We were bestowed darkness, scars, despair and agony.

00:10:53.200 --> 00:10:58.120
This trauma overtook my host's heart.

00:10:58.120 --> 00:11:00.400
The darkness took away his freedom.

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:03.700
And his self-torture created even more darkness in his heart.

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:09.650
The pain and hatred in his heart created me.

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:13.080
So he's Marik's other personality!

00:11:13.080 --> 00:11:17.000
My birthday was when he was 10 years old.

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:19.650
When he underwent the gravekeeper's ritual.

00:11:19.980 --> 00:11:28.050
His father inflicted pain and sadness, making Marik desire self-destruction.

00:11:28.050 --> 00:11:35.320
In order to survive, he had to create an alternate personality.  Me.

00:11:36.560 --> 00:11:41.310
I thought I could conquer his personality back then.

00:11:41.310 --> 00:11:45.020
But there was one thing that interfered with my plans.

00:11:45.020 --> 00:11:50.440
I can take over when he's angry, but...

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:59.880
When Rishido engraved his own face to soothe Marik, his anger was sealed away.

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:04.570
I was imprisoned deep inside Marik's heart.

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:12.170
But since he's unconscious, I'm now in control of this body!

00:12:12.680 --> 00:12:14.710
What's your goal?

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:16.610
The God Card?  Something else?

00:12:16.820 --> 00:12:18.000
Goal?

00:12:18.560 --> 00:12:20.050
I don't have one.

00:12:20.280 --> 00:12:29.720
But if I have to choose, I want to rule over all and destroy everyone!

00:12:29.960 --> 00:12:32.050
Destruction gives me pleasure.

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:34.660
I will rule the world!

00:12:34.660 --> 00:12:37.250
A world of darkness!

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:41.300
Marik!

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:04.650
I'll now bury her in darkness.

00:13:06.600 --> 00:13:07.690
Jonouchi!

00:13:08.030 --> 00:13:10.680
Before Marik attacks with Ra...

00:13:11.370 --> 00:13:12.080
Hey!

00:13:12.080 --> 00:13:13.720
Lower the Duel Ring!

00:13:13.720 --> 00:13:16.190
No!  The duel isn't over yet!

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:19.850
I'll disqualify you, Jonouchi!

00:13:19.850 --> 00:13:20.470
Be quiet!

00:13:21.180 --> 00:13:22.400
It's over...

00:13:23.530 --> 00:13:25.240
This is the end.

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:27.660
Ra!  Burn her to a crisp!

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:29.750
Mai!

00:13:29.980 --> 00:13:32.050
The Winged Dragon of Ra attacks!

00:13:34.990 --> 00:13:35.890
Mai!

00:13:36.290 --> 00:13:37.090
Die.

00:13:39.060 --> 00:13:39.860
Mai!

00:13:41.900 --> 00:13:43.620
Mai!  Run away!

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:46.800
It's the same voice as before...

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:47.880
Brother!

00:13:47.880 --> 00:13:48.740
Jonouchi!

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:50.680
It's pointless.

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:52.820
She doesn't remember you anymore.

00:13:54.500 --> 00:13:55.520
Damn!

00:13:57.150 --> 00:13:57.880
Who are you?

00:13:58.700 --> 00:14:00.800
Mai...  You...

00:14:01.640 --> 00:14:05.750
My heart hears a warm voice.

00:14:06.020 --> 00:14:10.080
You really don't recognize me?

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:12.840
I can hear it again...

00:14:14.180 --> 00:14:16.220
Mai, it's me!  Jonouchi!

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:16.860
Jo...

00:14:17.080 --> 00:14:19.140
Did you forget me?

00:14:19.140 --> 00:14:22.300
We're friends who've fought side-by-side!

00:14:22.650 --> 00:14:24.800
Friends...

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:28.910
You said you'll win and duel me and Yugi!

00:14:31.020 --> 00:14:33.680
I won't let you forget me!

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:36.480
I owe you a lot!

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:40.950
When I fell after being struck by lightning in my duel...

00:14:44.960 --> 00:14:47.600
Everyone saved me in my dream.

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:51.330
I was too weak to stand up.

00:14:51.330 --> 00:14:54.840
That's when my friends lent me a hand.

00:14:56.060 --> 00:14:57.940
Including you.

00:14:58.910 --> 00:15:01.860
I was too embarrassed to say you were there.

00:15:01.860 --> 00:15:04.180
But Mai!  You were there!

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:08.060
Jo...

00:15:08.430 --> 00:15:09.800
Jonouchi!

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:11.950
Mai!  You remember?

00:15:12.360 --> 00:15:15.350
Their bond overcame my dark powers.

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:16.860
But it's too late.

00:15:19.360 --> 00:15:22.120
Move!  This is my fight!

00:15:22.120 --> 00:15:23.560
Don't be silly!

00:15:23.560 --> 00:15:25.230
You have to escape!

00:15:25.660 --> 00:15:28.240
Damn!  Isn't this Solid Vision?

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:30.200
Why won't it open?

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:33.600
Jonouchi...  You were always there for me.

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:35.540
But I...

00:15:38.940 --> 00:15:40.410
Run, Jonouchi!

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:42.500
No way!  I can't do that!

00:15:43.060 --> 00:15:45.280
Go, The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:15:45.280 --> 00:15:47.180
God Blaze Cannon!

00:15:50.100 --> 00:15:52.420
You have another match!

00:15:52.420 --> 00:15:53.200
Run now!

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:54.960
I won't let my friend die!

00:15:55.480 --> 00:15:56.630
Jonouchi...

00:15:58.060 --> 00:15:59.800
Dammit!

00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:01.870
Thank you, Jonouchi.

00:16:02.400 --> 00:16:07.130
I entered this tournament because I wanted to see you again.

00:16:14.180 --> 00:16:14.880
Yugi!

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:20.640
How touching.

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:25.160
You took Ra's attack to protect your lame friends.

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:30.100
Marik, I'll take on your anger and hatred!

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:33.170
But I will send you back into the darkness!

00:16:35.020 --> 00:16:35.970
Yugi!

00:16:37.460 --> 00:16:38.970
Well said.

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:46.510
I will tear your body and the Millennium Puzzle into pieces, scattering them into eternal darkness!

00:16:52.760 --> 00:16:53.690
Yugi!

00:16:53.920 --> 00:16:54.620
Yugi!

00:16:55.540 --> 00:16:56.480
Yugi!

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:59.200
Pull yourself together, Yugi!

00:17:00.400 --> 00:17:04.420
Ra's attack eliminated her life points.

00:17:04.420 --> 00:17:06.270
The game is over.

00:17:06.270 --> 00:17:07.370
Hey judge.

00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:11.880
Announce my name as the winner.  Loudly!

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:15.660
The winner of the third match is Marik!

00:17:16.460 --> 00:17:20.000
The real Marik Ishtar.

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:23.350
Yugi!  Yugi!

00:17:32.930 --> 00:17:36.110
Shall I tear him limb from limb?

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:37.540
Don't you dare!

00:17:37.540 --> 00:17:39.640
Don't worry.  I was kidding.

00:17:40.250 --> 00:17:42.450
I'll finish him in a duel.

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:47.340
An ultimate Shadow Game between those chosen by the Millennium Items.

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:50.780
What?  I can't move.

00:17:52.160 --> 00:17:54.960
I can erase you anytime I want.

00:17:59.380 --> 00:18:03.520
I'm taking my Ra card back.

00:18:04.120 --> 00:18:08.880
You've managed to live, but you may come to regret this.

00:18:09.120 --> 00:18:11.760
Death may have been a better choice.

00:18:11.780 --> 00:18:15.670
In a Shadow Game, the loser is punished.

00:18:16.420 --> 00:18:17.420
Punished?

00:18:17.600 --> 00:18:23.640
Mai Kujaku, enjoy the world of pain that's inside your heart!

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:38.280
Jonouchi!

00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:46.130
This is your subconscious.

00:18:48.740 --> 00:18:51.340
They're having fun.

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:55.970
But you'll never be able to join them.

00:18:56.880 --> 00:19:00.910
Sand that absorbs your memories are above this Ra card.

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:09.280
When you're completely buried, you lose all your memories and die slowly...  Slowly...

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:13.130
Your friends will vanish, and you'll be alone.

00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:14.860
Good night.

00:19:14.860 --> 00:19:16.830
I'm taking my card back.

00:19:24.050 --> 00:19:25.510
Jonouchi...

00:19:36.640 --> 00:19:37.680
Mai!

00:19:37.680 --> 00:19:40.120
Marik!  What did you do?

00:19:40.120 --> 00:19:44.050
I invited her to walk into the darkness.

00:19:44.050 --> 00:19:47.290
She has the pleasure of being all alone.

00:19:47.500 --> 00:19:51.730
She no longer remembers you or Yugi.

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:52.660
What?

00:19:52.660 --> 00:19:55.670
She's forgetting where she was born, how she lived...

00:19:55.670 --> 00:19:58.700
Why she lived.

00:19:59.100 --> 00:20:02.770
She'll wander in loneliness forever and never wake up.

00:20:02.770 --> 00:20:06.250
Maybe you can save her if you defeat me.

00:20:07.740 --> 00:20:09.950
How dare you keep hurting my friends!

00:20:10.250 --> 00:20:12.080
I'm furious, Marik!

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:13.970
I'll defeat you!

00:20:14.820 --> 00:20:18.450
Don't worry.  I'll send you into the darkness too.

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:30.970
My power has been freed.

00:20:30.970 --> 00:20:36.520
The more I sacrifice to the darkness, the more powerful I become.

00:20:39.900 --> 00:20:41.250
Mai, wake up!

00:20:41.250 --> 00:20:42.140
Mai!

00:20:42.140 --> 00:20:43.450
She's unconscious.

00:20:44.020 --> 00:20:46.170
Unless we defeat Marik, Mai will be...

00:20:46.170 --> 00:20:48.580
Just wait, Mai.  I promise to save you.

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:50.890
You're awake, Yugi!

00:20:51.200 --> 00:20:52.000
Yugi!

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:53.910
Yugi, pull yourself together!

00:20:54.070 --> 00:20:55.540
I'm fine.

00:20:55.540 --> 00:20:57.330
Jonouchi, how's Mai?

00:20:57.330 --> 00:20:58.560
Well...

00:20:59.220 --> 00:21:00.770
Due to Marik...

00:21:01.180 --> 00:21:04.380
Marik's subconscious created a dark personality.

00:21:04.380 --> 00:21:05.940
I won't forgive his dark side!

00:21:06.560 --> 00:21:09.270
Yugi, don't do anything that crazy again.

00:21:09.270 --> 00:21:10.620
Seriously.

00:21:11.110 --> 00:21:12.210
Mokuba?

00:21:12.510 --> 00:21:14.020
Big brother!

00:21:14.020 --> 00:21:16.480
I successfully scanned Ra's text.

00:21:16.480 --> 00:21:18.150
I'm going to analyze it.

00:21:18.150 --> 00:21:20.020
I see.  Thanks.

00:21:20.020 --> 00:21:23.090
I'll be dueling in the fourth match.

00:21:23.400 --> 00:21:24.370
Yugi!

00:21:24.370 --> 00:21:26.720
Take the loser and clear out!

00:21:27.170 --> 00:21:28.160
Kaiba!

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:35.720
This location will become the sacred land for my God, Obelisk!

00:21:43.860 --> 00:21:48.080
We're still shocked from Mai's defeat, but the fourth match is starting.

00:21:48.080 --> 00:21:52.080
Kaiba's opponent is an unknown 8th duelist.

00:21:52.080 --> 00:21:56.040
Huh?  You're Ishizu, the person we met at the Egyptian exhibit!

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:57.820
Why are you here?

00:21:58.160 --> 00:22:02.760
Using her Millennium Necklace to see the future, Ishizu predicts Kaiba's defeat.

00:22:02.980 --> 00:22:04.960
Kaiba ridicules her, but...

00:22:05.220 --> 00:22:08.660
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Kaiba vs The 8th Duelist

00:22:08.660 --> 00:22:10.020
Duel, standby!

00:22:13.690 --> 00:22:21.570
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:21.570 --> 00:22:30.510
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:30.870 --> 00:22:35.510
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:35.510 --> 00:22:39.480
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:39.910 --> 00:22:47.450
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:47.450 --> 00:22:51.020
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:51.020 --> 00:22:55.790
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:55.790 --> 00:23:05.900
And walk it without stopping

00:23:05.900 --> 00:23:13.510
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:13.740 --> 00:23:22.480
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:22.480 --> 00:23:30.460
I want to trust myself
Sometimes I'll lose my way but

00:23:30.460 --> 00:23:40.300
I hide it in my heart...
Secret Paradise
